Z||000004||87GT||02-24-2000||10:21 PM||||That is what bothers me about seeing other fieros on the road.  The majority of fieros I see are in pretty raggedy condition.  Whenever I see one like this, I think to myself, "I wonder how long its gonna be before I see it in a dump?"  4 out every 5 fieros I see, are in bad shape with lights up, terrible paint, cracked this and that.  I am sure all of you know what I mean.  The little fiero just deserves more respect.||||reg||9
